 e starts at Forfar Park in Fergus\, passes Belwood Lake\, then turns aroun
 d near Hillsburgh and heads back to Fergus. Plan on an 'apres-ride' gather
 ing at The Brewhouse on the Grand in Fergus to celebrate the finish! As th
 is is planned as an advanced Urban Roller-level ride as well as a Tourist-
 level ride\, expect the average group speed to be in the range of 20 kph. 
